10-22T11:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4923560-1846651706692588","game_id":"steam-4923560","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Uyar Party Demo is at Steam Next Fest!🎉 Uyar Party Demo is at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone! 💛Uyar Party Demo is officially part of Steam Next Fest! 🎉It's been a really long journey getting here. Along the way, I've fixed countless issues, changed game mechanics, optimized things, and learned so much. There have been plenty of challenges, but seeing the game slowly come together has made it all worthwhile!I also want to give a big thank you to everyone who has supported me along the way! Whether you've played the demo, shared feedback, reported bugs, or simply cheered me o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:13:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4923560-1845383656389795","game_id":"steam-4923560","kind":"announcement","title":"250+ Wishlists! Thank You! 🎉","summary":"The Uyar Party Demo has only been out for a few days, and we’ve already passed 250 wishlists!Thank you so much to everyone who has played the demo, added Uyar Party to their wishlist, shared feedback, left a review, or simply told someone about the game. Seeing new players discovering and enjoying something I’ve spent so much time working on has been amazing.And to celebrate, I’m adding a 5th minigame to the demo!I want the demo to give you an even better taste of what the full game is going to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T19:11:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389795","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:51Z","discovery_method":"officia